WEBVTT

00:01:30.285 --> 00:01:32.709
So your random guess was not far off.

00:01:33.029 --> 00:01:35.055
And I don't know
whether that makes me more

00:01:35.079 --> 00:01:36.658
or even less impressed with you.

00:01:36.682 --> 00:01:38.062
(Dave laughs)

00:01:38.409 --> 00:01:40.063
Why should we accept you then?

00:01:40.087 --> 00:01:45.864
DC: I think that my story
is not your typical story,

00:01:45.888 --> 00:01:48.255
and on paper, I'm a total zero,

00:01:48.279 --> 00:01:51.972
but I think I figured out a way,
through determination,

00:01:51.996 --> 00:01:54.909
an incredible amount of luck,

00:01:54.933 --> 00:02:00.594
to figure out how to sort of,
carve out my own niche in the food world.